      "code": "a = ['000100', '101101', '111111', '110100', '111011', '001110']\nb = 0\n\ndef f(p, q, r):\n    global b\n    if p < 0 or q < 0 or p >= 6 or q >= 6:\n        return\n    if a[p][q] == '0':\n        return\n    b += r\n    a[p] = a[p][:q] + '0' + a[p][q+1:]\n    f(p-1, q, r+1)\n    f(p+1, q, r+1)\n    f(p, q-1, r+1)\n    f(p, q+1, r+1)\n\nfor i in range(6):\n    for j in range(6):\n        if ord(a[i][j]) == 49:\n            f(i, j, 1)\nprint(b)",
